---
interface Props {
  name: string;
}

const { name } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="os-window__scroll product-placeholder">
  <section class="product-placeholder__hero">
    <span class="product-placeholder__eyebrow">Placeholder</span>
    <h2>{name}</h2>
    <p>这个应用已经放进桌面系统了，窗口内容先保留占位，后面再单独补完整介绍和交互。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="product-placeholder__card">
    <strong>Next step</strong>
    <span>后续可以补官网链接、项目定位、关键特性和更贴近产品本身的窗口视觉。</span>
  </section>
</div>
